text = "This is your hand. It contains tiles with rivers connecting
all of the factories on the map.

Left-click to select it. Press Q/E to rotate it.
RIght-click  to discard it. The cards replenish after some time.
You may have up to 5 cards in your hand at a time.

The rainbow tile is infinite. After discarding you will
get a new tile immediately, but you will only get a basic one.
"
horizontal_alignment = 1

